# Galian Beast stolen by Bot2 (Act of Treason) dies under Bot2's control; its "return it to the battlefield tapped" is
# Bot2's ability (CR 603.3a), and with no "under its owner's control" it enters under Bot2's control (CR 110.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Vincent Valentine
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Act of Treason
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vincent Valentine.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Vincent Valentine > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Act of Treason.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Galian Beast)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Galian Beast.Power = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Galian Beast)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Vincent Valentine.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Vincent Valentine.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet
